`),choices:o,sampleAnswer:{correctChoiceIndex:e,explanation:["The designer should have conducted a detailed analysis of the design requirements","initially to prevent the prototype from lacking expected functions.","","A thorough analysis of the design brief and client requirements at the outset","ensures all expected features, functions, and specifications are clearly understood","before any design or production work begins. This prevents misunderstandings","about what the product must do.","","More market research would improve knowledge of the target market but not","necessarily the specific functions required by this client.","A comprehensive financial plan addresses cost management, not functional outcomes.","Producing additional sketches would assist visual communication but not address","the fundamental failure to identify all required functions."].join(`
`)}}}},eqe=["DT-DP-7"],tqe=["prototyping, testing, and evaluation in the design process","project planning and iterative improvement"],nqe={id:"design_and_technology/2015/q09",version:1,variants:4,syllabusTopics:[...eqe],learningTopics:tqe,generate(t){const e=[0,1,2,3][t],n="reduce manufacturing risks.",i=["allow more effective teamwork.","make the market more competitive.","encourage more funding for testing."],o=[];let a=0;for(let s=0;s<4;s++)o.push(s===e?n:i[a++]);return{question:"One benefit of making a prototype prior to construction is that it could",choices:o,sampleAnswer:{correctChoiceIndex:e,explanation:["Making a prototype prior to construction can reduce manufacturing risks.","","A prototype allows designers and engineers to identify and resolve design flaws,","material incompatibilities, and production challenges before full-scale manufacturing","begins. This prevents costly errors, material waste, and production delays that","would be far more expensive to fix after mass production has started.","","While prototyping may involve teamwork and attract interest from stakeholders,","these are incidental benefits rather than the primary purpose.","Prototyping is an internal design activity; it does not directly increase","market competition or generate external funding."].join(`
