`),choices:o,sampleAnswer:{correctChoiceIndex:e,explanation:["Using a variety of research methods is important because it improves understanding","of customer needs.","","Different research methods — such as surveys, interviews, observation, and","competitor analysis — each capture different aspects of what users want, how they","behave, and what problems they face. Using multiple methods allows a designer to","build a richer and more accurate picture of customer needs, reducing the risk of","designing a product that misses the mark.","","While research may inform marketing strategies, that is a secondary benefit.","Research methods do not specifically promote emerging technologies or protect","intellectual property — those are separate design considerations."].join(`
`)}}}},sqe=["DT-DP-6","DT-DP-7"],rqe=["design factors and criteria for success","selecting materials and features to suit purpose","work health and safety in design and production","risk assessment and safe work practices"],hI=[{product:"desk lamp",details:"that uses a variety of materials",specificPractices:["The lamp incorporates electrical components, so all wiring must be carried out by a","licensed electrician and all electrical parts must be tested and tagged according to","relevant legislation.","","When cutting and shaping wooden or metal components for the lamp's stand, appropriate","personal protective equipment (PPE) should be worn, including safety glasses to","protect against flying particles, a dust mask when sanding, and hearing protection","when using power tools."].join(`
`)},{product:"wooden shelf unit",details:"that uses a variety of materials including timber and metal fixings",specificPractices:["The shelf unit uses timber and metal fixings, so a risk assessment must be carried","out before construction begins to identify hazards associated with cutting, drilling,","and assembling these materials.","","Safety glasses must be worn when cutting timber and drilling metal to protect against","flying particles. A dust mask should be worn during sanding to prevent inhalation of","fine particles. Hearing protection is required when using power saws or drills."].join(`
