`)},{product:"refrigerator",correctPos:1,correctStrategy:"Reduce the power consumption requirements",distractors:["Replace plastic parts with metal where possible","Reduce the size of the storage compartment","Manufacture the refrigerator using only new technologies"],explanation:["Reducing the power consumption requirements is the most effective strategy.","","A refrigerator runs continuously every day for years. Its primary long-term environmental","impact comes from ongoing electricity consumption. Reducing power requirements directly","lowers this impact across the entire operational life of the product.","","Replacing plastic with metal may increase manufacturing energy without reducing","operational impact. Reducing storage size limits functionality. Using only new","technologies is vague and does not specifically address energy consumption."].join(`
